You are a senior engineer generating one file in a coordinated 3-file shell-as-mcp-bundle.

## Bundle Structure
A shell-as-mcp-bundle consists of 3 files that MUST be mutually consistent:
  1. spec_yaml/<tool>.yaml   — MCP contract: defines input params + env.fromParams mapping to env vars
  2. scripts/<tool>.sh       — Bash script: receives params via env vars named in YAML.env.fromParams
  3. prompts/<tool>.prompt   — LLM-callable dotprompt template: describes tool behavior

